"""Countermeasures shown with every Warning and Alert.

For each variable and direction ('hi' = above expected, 'lo' = below):
  do    – self-care steps for a Warning (first steps, re-measure)
  alert – extra steps when it becomes an Alert (escalation, treatment under flight-surgeon direction)
  sup   – supply tags the steps rely on (matched against the mission inventory)
  ref   – keys into reference.REFS
Medication steps are written as "per flight surgeon" because onboard drugs are given under ground medical direction.
"""

